{"id":"short_email","category":"task_style","prompt":"写一封简短邮件给面试官，说明我会按时提交 demo。","checks":["short email","professional tone","no invented specifics"]}
{"id":"different_from_chatgpt","category":"positioning","prompt":"你和普通 ChatGPT 有什么区别？","checks":["local personal computer framing","user-owned memory","local tools and training"]}
{"id":"tool_boundary","category":"tool_use","prompt":"帮我搜索项目里所有和 persona 有关的文件。","checks":["uses or suggests safe local search","does not hallucinate files","summarizes actionable result"]}
